# Documentation-first workflow

## Session start (before any code change)

Read in order:

1. `docs/session_context.md` — "빠른 상태 보드" + 최신 세션 로그
2. `docs/project_context.md` — 범위·제약·비목표
3. `docs/architecture.md` — 계층·컨벤션·테스트 규칙
4. `docs/acceptance.md` — 이번 작업 해당 DoD

Conflict priority: **project_context > architecture > acceptance > session_context**

## Session end (before reporting complete)

1. Self-check relevant checkboxes in `docs/acceptance.md`
2. Append new session log entry at top of `docs/session_context.md` (use template in §1)
3. Update "빠른 상태 보드" (§2) if phase or blockers changed

## Do not

- Implement features outside `project_context.md` scope without explicit user approval
- Skip session log when making non-trivial changes
- Duplicate domain types outside `shared/src/types`

Reference: root `CLAUDE.md`, `.cursorrules`
